Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many different rooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too excited, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,love hotels aren't really\Nvery convincing, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This room is so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wasn't comfortable leaving her at home\Nwhile away on business,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.81,0:00:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I'd be fine staying\Nat a cheap business hotel,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and yeah, a love hotel is\Na little embarrassing but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.11,0:00:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh well!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the besssst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me so happy to\Nsee you this pleased, Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I'm sure it has nothing\Nto do with us being in a place{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where it's easy\Nto pressure me into sex!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And there it is!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, so I've got a really\Nlong meeting this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so I kinda gotta go and prep\Nfor that in the meantime, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall remain on standby so\Nthat I do not interfere with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow, guess she really can read the room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, see you tomorrow, then!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it!\NSee you then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And she seriously hasn't\Ndone anything since then?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was expecting her to come and\Nperv out on me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but no, nothing...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Akane?\N- Yeah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is your meeting over now?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here we go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now it's coming.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How the heck am I supposed to sleep?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6}EXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She hasn't tried making a move?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, I have an early start\Ntomorrow, so I should sleep, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just calm down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- I can't take it anymore!\N- Huh? The TV?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:01:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't this stupid thing work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman reminds me of you, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In the way she responds during sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to experience\Nsomething like that right now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I need it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You need what?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go on, let me hear it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know! Don't make me say it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}I wanna hear you beg, cutie.{\i0}\N- So, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need you to make me cum!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't say that, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Then leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nade... shiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm just glad I was\Nable to help, Nadeshiko!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you were a great help!\NBy the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why did you only get in touch with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}{\an1\blur0.7\c&H020204&\fax-0.049076\fscx108.10\fscy121.27\frz-2.8340\frx0.1206\fry-1.3861\xbord0.00\ybord0.00\xshad0.00\yshad0.00\org(894.39,242.2)\pos(590.02,285.85)}Call me! I mi{\c&H7A797E&}ss you~~
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}{\an1\blur0.7\c&H020204&\fax0.013772\fscx109.45\fscy122.12\frz-6.0486\frx0.1199\fry-1.3774\xbord0.00\ybord0.00\xshad0.00\yshad0.00\org(914.86,970.6)\pos(761.78,1014.55)}Your Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,440)\fs33\bord2.5\blur0.5\b0\shad0\3c&HD0377A&\c&HF7FFFC&\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pro R\pos(274,312)}Brought to you by ToonsHub
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, it's a little too early for\Nme to meet with your master.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I am eager to introduce\NAkane to you very soon, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmm. Is that so?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a1}{\i1}Once she's officially become your\Nmaster, the two of you can come visit me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll try even harder to\Nget her to authenticate with me!

